# COL764 PROJECT
# RESEARCH-GRADE VALIDATION OF ANN RECALL VS IR UTILITY
#
# IMPORTANT:
# This script REUSES the expensive artifacts generated by:
#
#     04_msmarco_large_pilot.py
#
# It does NOT re-encode the corpus or rebuild the HNSW index.
#
# Main questions:
#
# RQ1:
# Does ANN Recall@10 require more HNSW effort than preserving
# downstream nDCG@10?
#
# RQ2:
# Does ANN Recall@100 require more effort than preserving
# qrel-based Recall@100?
#
# RQ3:
# Are any observed budget differences statistically reliable
# at the QUERY level?
#
# RQ4:
# Is the effect concentrated on hard / ambiguous queries?
#
# RQ5:
# Does the result differ between MS MARCO dev queries and
# deeply judged TREC-DL-2019 queries?
#
# This script deliberately does NOT claim to reproduce DARTH,
# Patience, Terminus, or any other published method.
#
# Those baselines come AFTER this phenomenon validation.
# ============================================================


